#
# This directory decides what a sandboxed interpreter may ever be asked to do.
# Two things here need a second reader, and neither is caught by a build:
#
#   source/entrypoints.json          a new row widens what a worker may be
#                                    asked for, and removing a
#                                    `native_alternative` widens it further -
#                                    that edit moves a capability from the
#                                    product's own code into a sandbox.
#   tool_entrypoint_registry.cc      the only gate. Everything it refuses is a
#                                    process this build would otherwise start.
per-file tool_entrypoint_registry*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
